": [640, 70], "pos": [-3198.11572265625, 1620.8009033203125], "id": 10, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"directory_invalid": true, "name": "minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors", "directory": "vae", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors"}], "ver": "0.33.1", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"vae_name": true}, "Node name for S&R": "VAELoader", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#653", "groupcolor": "#b58b2a", "color": "#432"}}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [48], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#46c25b", "widgets_values": ["integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, realistic film look with subtle grain, at night inside an empty 1950s-style American diner with red vinyl stools, a chrome-edged counter, empty booths and a dark plate-glass window carrying a glowing red neon \"OPEN\" sign, warm overhead pendant lights against the cool blue night outside. A waitress in her late twenties with dark hair in a low ponytail, wearing a pale mint short-sleeve uniform dress with a white collar and apron, is closing up alone. The shot opens on a wide eye-level view down the length of the diner and pushes in very slowly and steadily throughout, letting the quiet linger between beats. For the first stretch she works unhurried behind the counter, and at frame 97 she leans on both hands and wipes the counter with a cloth, head lowered in a slow closing-up motion, matching the first reference. She works along the counter for several slow beats, straightens, sets the cloth aside, and as a faint sound comes from the entrance the camera keeps drifting toward her; at frame 213, in a closer slightly low angle, she lifts her head and looks off toward the entrance with mildly raised eyebrows and parted lips as if hearing the door, warm pendant light and a faint red neon reflection on her face, matching the second reference. The view then cuts to her point of view looking toward the glass entrance door, and at frame 311 a man in his thirties in a rain-damp dark overcoat stands just inside the open doorway, one hand on the door with water dripping, hunched from the cold and backlit by cool blue street light and red neon, his face half-lit and uncertain, matching the third reference. He steps in and crosses to the counter as the camera drifts down and around into a tight two-shot, and at frame 431 the waitress sets down a white coffee mug in front of him with a small warm tentative smile as he looks up at her from a red vinyl stool, warm pendant light pooling on the counter between them, matching the fourth reference. They hold the quiet exchange, steam rising from the mug, the man's hand moving to wrap around it, as the camera eases gently closer on the two of them in the warm pooled light on the final frame.\noverall_soundscape: A quiet late-night diner ambience with the low hum of refrigeration and a faint buzz from the neon sign, the soft wet wipe of the cloth on the counter, distant muffled street sound and light rain outside, the small jingle and creak of the door opening, the man's damp footsteps crossing the floor and the creak of a vinyl stool, and the gentle ceramic set-down of the coffee mug on the counter.\nnon_diegetic_music: A slow melancholy jazz feel with brushed drums, a soft upright bass and a lone muted trumpet plays quietly at a very slow tempo, thinning almost to silence as she lifts her head toward the door, returning softly as the man steps inside, and swelling gently as the mug is set down before holding into the final frame."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#32ae47", "size": [403.1758728027344, 662.0624389